#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, glCrashedWarning)
#: compositing.ui:31
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"OpenGL compositing (the default) has crashed KWin in the past.\n"
"This was most likely due to a driver bug.\n"
"If you think that you have meanwhile upgraded to a stable driver,\n"
"you can reset this protection but be aware that this might result in an "
"immediate crash!"
msgstr ""
"之前本机上的 KWin 在默认设置下使用 OpenGL 渲染模式时发生过崩溃。\n"
"这可能是因为当时安装了存在缺陷的旧版显示驱动程序。\n"
"如果您的系统已升级为更稳定的新型显示驱动程序，\n"
"您可以取消这项保护措施，但有可能造成 KWin 立即再次崩溃！"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, scaleWarning)
#: compositing.ui:44
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Scale method \"Accurate\" is not supported by all hardware and can cause "
"performance regressions and rendering artifacts."
msgstr "并非所有硬件都支持“精确”缩放模式，而且这种模式也可能导致性能下降和渲染错误。"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, windowThumbnailWarning)
#: compositing.ui:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Keeping the window thumbnail always interferes with the minimized state of "
"windows. This can result in windows not suspending their work when minimized."
msgstr "启用保持窗口缩略图功能会影响窗口的最小化行为，可能导致已被最小化的窗口继续运"
"行。"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, compositingLabel)
#: compositing.ui:79
#, kde-format
msgid "Compositing:"
msgstr "显示合成特效："

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Enabled)
#: compositing.ui:86
#, kde-format
msgid "Enable on startup"
msgstr "开机自启"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_WindowsBlockCompositing)
#: compositing.ui:95
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Applications can set a hint to block compositing when the window is open.\n"
" This brings performance improvements for e.g. games.\n"
" The setting can be overruled by window-specific rules."
msgstr ""
"允许应用程序在窗口可见时阻止合成特效。\n"
"此选项有助于提高游戏等应用程序的性能表现。\n"
"窗口的特殊规则可能会覆盖此设置。"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_WindowsBlockCompositing)
#: compositing.ui:98
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow applications to block compositing"
msgstr "允许应用阻止合成特效"

